* dbx gain module 200, drawing 110557 rev 01, dated 3-27-75.
* Independent transistor reference for the calibrated application. Rails +7.5/-15 V.
* R1 || R10 is selected until input DC offset vanishes. R2/R13 factory selection
* and optional R11 injection are omitted for matched pairs with driven control bases.
* Philips BC109C / BC179B cards, NSC 2N3687 (Siliconix cross-reference KE3687),
* generic 1N914. See tests/bench/DBX-160-MODULES.md for provenance and limits.
.subckt DBX200_REF in out pi ni po no plus minus common
R1trim plus q1b 27071.178
C1 q1b q1c 560p
J3 q1b in common JN
Q1 q1c q1b q1e N109
D1 q1e common D914
R3 plus q1c 2.2k
R4 plus q2e 390
R5 q1c q2e 220
Q2 ep q1c q2e P179
Q4 in pi ep P179
Q5 out bp ep P179
R12 bp po 22
Q7 in bn en N109
Q8 out no en N109
R9 ni bn 22
Q6 ep q6b en N109
R6 ep q6b 390
R7 q6b en 1k
R8 en minus 4.7k
.ends
